# Controller / Steam Deck path (default pad bindings): hold X = hotspots, Back = F1 menu,
# B = close menu, D-pad Up = quick save, D-pad Down = quick load (back to l/001).
#! threshold 01_pad_x_hotspots 0.12   (hotspot markers pulse with wall-clock time)
wait video 60
1000 tap Escape
wait menu 60
1500 quicksave
+300 quickload
+1500 expect menu
1500 click 60 553
wait room x/006 30
1500 click 114 566
+2000 tap Escape
wait room l/001 30
500 quicksave
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+2500 click 400 300
+11000 expect hotspots 15
+0 pad x down
+700 shotfull 01_pad_x_hotspots
+0 pad x up
+400 padtap back
+800 shotfull 02_pad_back_menu
+0 padtap b
+600 padtap dpup
+4000 expect room l/001
+0 savecheck 9
+0 clickspot Tür
wait room l/005 30
3000 padtap dpdown
wait room l/001 30
3000 expect hotspots 15
+300 quit
